    <panel_attributes>requestJson sends one repair request if the reply is not valid JSON.
If the model says the excerpts do not cover the question, the same not-covered path is used.
With allowGeneral, the not-covered path asks the model for a clearly labelled general answer.
extractConcepts() and explainAnswer() (UC02, UC08) follow the same build, requestJson and chat sequence.</panel_attributes>
